WEBVTT

00:00.140 --> 00:01.810
Marta, it's Ansel.

00:01.750 --> 00:04.120
I'm on the Meridian sleeper to Lorne.

00:04.120 --> 00:06.760
Carriage four's brake certificates are forged.

00:06.700 --> 00:10.700
The same stamp on every one, from a depot that has been closed since the floods.

00:10.640 --> 00:12.740
I know who signs them on the train.

00:12.680 --> 00:15.920
I will say the name at Lorne, in front of the board.

00:15.860 --> 00:16.700
Not before.

00:16.640 --> 00:18.120
Keep this message safe.
